Addresses the remaining unchecked items in `TODO.md` across `Co3Ne.h`, `Co3NeManifoldExtractor.h`, and `Co3NeManifoldStitcher.h`.

## Correctness fixes

- **1.7 `MergeConnectedComponent` BFS** — replaced O(T) linear scan with BFS via `mCornerToAdjacentFacet`. The old scan flipped triangles in arbitrary order, corrupting the corner circular-lists. Call site now passes the known starting triangle so BFS never needs to scan.
- **2.2.2 Orphaned vertices on hole-fill revert** — saved `vertices.size()` alongside `triangles.size()` before each `FillHoles` call; both are restored on non-manifold rollback.

## Algorithm cleanup

- **1.1 Legacy O(k²) generator** — the old `GenerateTriangles` fan body and the corresponding T3/T12 `ExtractManifold` branch are now guarded by `#ifdef GTE_DEBUG`. The default path calls `Co3NeManifoldExtractor` directly with all unique candidates.
- **2.3.3 Extractor deduplication** — `Co3Ne::ExtractManifold` no longer has an inline reimplementation; the legacy path is debug-only.
- **2.2.1 Duplicate hole-filling** — removed Step 6 (`FillHoles` after `BallPivotMeshHoleFiller`); Step 4 is the single canonical call.
- **2.2.3 `AbsorbSmallClosedComponents` default** — changed `absorbSmallClosedComponents` default to `false`; small closed artifact components are now discarded rather than incorrectly spliced into the main mesh via triangle splitting.

## Performance

- **2.2.4 `RemoveNonManifoldEdges`** — replaced `vector::erase` in a loop (O(N·T)) with a single in-place compaction pass (O(T)):
  ```cpp
  // Before: O(T) per erase inside a loop
  for (auto idx : sortedToRemove)
      triangles.erase(triangles.begin() + idx);

  // After: single O(T) compaction
  size_t writeIdx = 0;
  for (size_t readIdx = 0; readIdx < triangles.size(); ++readIdx)
      if (!removeFlag[readIdx])
          triangles[writeIdx++] = triangles[readIdx];
  triangles.resize(writeIdx);
  ```

## Default changes

- **2.2.5** `targetSingleComponent` changed from `true` → `false` — prevents unconditional bridging of unrelated components.

## Parameter removal (Part 3)

Removed five parameters that were workarounds for now-fixed bugs: `relaxedManifoldExtraction`, `bypassManifoldExtraction`, `autoFixNonManifold`, `fixWindingOrder`, `preventSelfIntersections`, along with their implementation functions (`AutoFixNonManifoldEdges`, `FixWindingOrder`, `RemoveSelfIntersectingTriangles`). All test references updated.

`triangleQualityThreshold` and `smoothWithRVD` cost are now documented inline in the `Parameters` struct.

